<title>USA: Sallie Mae to redeem callable notes.</title>
<headline>Sallie Mae to redeem callable notes.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Student Loan Marketing Association said Tuesday that on March 28 it will redeem the following callable notes in their entirety:</p>
<p>    Interest	Maturity	 Cusip</p>
<p>	7.44	  3/28/00	863871UD9</p>
<p>Accrued interest of $37.20 per $1,000 face amount will also be paid on March 28. The notes are worth a par amount of $300 million.</p>
<p>Sallie Mae said principal will be repaid at 100 percent of the face amount. Payment will be made to holders of record as of the close of business March 27, it said.</p>
</text>
